{"product":{"id":10065156997408,"title":"Martello Trail","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe most versatile trail tire for hardpack to mixed trails.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen your trail offers a wild mix of steeps, hardpack, and mixed surfaces, Martello Trail rises to the occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDurable, moto-inspired tread blocks deliver reliable grip, while progressive siping ensures a responsive trail feel, balancing control and stability through every turn. Wide spacing between knobs provides self-cleaning performance, shedding loose soil and sticky mud so traction stays consistent ride after ride.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVittoria’s 4Compound Formulation strategically places four optimized rubber compounds where they’re needed, giving a perfect blend of speed, grip, and long-lasting durability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Trail casing combines lightweight design with toughness, featuring a tubeless-ready nylon construction, reinforced sidewalls, and an anti-puncture belt—ready for technical climbs, challenging descents, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"MTB Tire","created_at":"2025-10-02T21:13:59-05:00","handle":"martello-trail","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:08:47-05:00","published_at":"2025-11-18T09:05:48-06:00","template_suffix":"xc-trail-template","published_scope":"global","tags":"Discounted products, Enduro\/Trail, EP70, IPP40, MTB, Sitewide, Tires, Trail Case","variants":[{"id":50758678184224,"product_id":10065156997408,"title":"27.5x2.4 \/ Black","price":"96.99","sku":"11A00782","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"27.5x2.4","option2":"Black","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-10-02T21:14:00-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:08:47-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"8022530036344","grams":1010,"image_id":50972700639520,"weight":1010.0,"weight_unit":"g","tax_code":"","requires_ship